    "detailed_description": "To win in Mineralis, not only do you have to beat the game, you have to understand it. In this <strong>fresh take on the JRPG genre</strong>, you\u2019ll discover the powerful shaping force of <strong>deep relationships and moral dilemmas</strong>. In a land torn by conflict, it is not the bravest or the most capable who will win, but the one who will make the right decisions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948210/extras/d33edc459ef229055208aafb07cb6f83.poster.avif?t=1677084025\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948210/extras/d33edc459ef229055208aafb07cb6f83.webm?t=1677084025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948210/extras/d33edc459ef229055208aafb07cb6f83.mp4?t=1677084025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEEP JRPG EXPERIENCE</h2><br>Meet a <strong>full set of unique characters</strong>, each vividly portrayed and with their own personalities. Their rich psychological representation offers you various ways to interact with them. Engage in <strong>meaningful discussions</strong> about Mineralis, the journey, and how they view you. Or skip the dialogues entirely. <strong>It\u2019s up to you</strong> to decide how you would treat them.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHOICES AND CONSEQUENCES</h2><br>What you do \u2013 and what you don\u2019t \u2013 impacts the <strong>living world</strong> of Mineralis. Will you trust the foreigner asking for help, not knowing if he is lying to you? Will you risk your companions\u2019 lives crossing a cave overrun by ogres just to take a shortcut?<br><br><strong>Everything is meaningful</strong>, and the outcomes are not linear.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948210/extras/86ef07399d458ea96dc4a981db33d8ed.poster.avif?t=1677084025\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948210/extras/86ef07399d458ea96dc4a981db33d8ed.webm?t=1677084025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948210/extras/86ef07399d458ea96dc4a981db33d8ed.mp4?t=1677084025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TACTICAL COMBAT. EASY TO LEARN, HARD TO MASTER</h2><br>In Mineralis, winning a fight is not a mere elaboration of stats, but rather, it requires precise thinking. <strong>Adapt your strategy</strong> at every turn, switch between targets or focus your attacks creatively to prevail. <strong>The risk of death is real</strong>, so spend the time you need to correctly assess the situation. And remember. <strong>Sometimes, the best option is to avoid combat!</strong><br><br><strong>Mineralis is calling for you. Shape your story and immerse yourself in this epic journey.</strong><br><br><strong>The themes discussed in this game are not suitable for children.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "To win in Mineralis, not only do you have to beat the game, you have to understand it. In this <strong>fresh take on the JRPG genre</strong>, you\u2019ll discover the powerful shaping force of <strong>deep relationships and moral dilemmas</strong>. In a land torn by conflict, it is not the bravest or the most capable who will win, but the one who will make the right decisions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948210/extras/d33edc459ef229055208aafb07cb6f83.poster.avif?t=1677084025\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948210/extras/d33edc459ef229055208aafb07cb6f83.webm?t=1677084025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948210/extras/d33edc459ef229055208aafb07cb6f83.mp4?t=1677084025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEEP JRPG EXPERIENCE</h2><br>Meet a <strong>full set of unique characters</strong>, each vividly portrayed and with their own personalities. Their rich psychological representation offers you various ways to interact with them. Engage in <strong>meaningful discussions</strong> about Mineralis, the journey, and how they view you. Or skip the dialogues entirely. <strong>It\u2019s up to you</strong> to decide how you would treat them.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHOICES AND CONSEQUENCES</h2><br>What you do \u2013 and what you don\u2019t \u2013 impacts the <strong>living world</strong> of Mineralis. Will you trust the foreigner asking for help, not knowing if he is lying to you? Will you risk your companions\u2019 lives crossing a cave overrun by ogres just to take a shortcut?<br><br><strong>Everything is meaningful</strong>, and the outcomes are not linear.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948210/extras/86ef07399d458ea96dc4a981db33d8ed.poster.avif?t=1677084025\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948210/extras/86ef07399d458ea96dc4a981db33d8ed.webm?t=1677084025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948210/extras/86ef07399d458ea96dc4a981db33d8ed.mp4?t=1677084025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TACTICAL COMBAT. EASY TO LEARN, HARD TO MASTER</h2><br>In Mineralis, winning a fight is not a mere elaboration of stats, but rather, it requires precise thinking. <strong>Adapt your strategy</strong> at every turn, switch between targets or focus your attacks creatively to prevail. <strong>The risk of death is real</strong>, so spend the time you need to correctly assess the situation. And remember. <strong>Sometimes, the best option is to avoid combat!</strong><br><br><strong>Mineralis is calling for you. Shape your story and immerse yourself in this epic journey.</strong><br><br><strong>The themes discussed in this game are not suitable for children.</strong>",
    "short_description": "Make an impact in the living, breathing world of Mineralis. Think, talk and fight your way through challenging combat and moral dilemmas. A hyper-meaningful JRPG with rich characters and unique encounters awaits your decision...",
